Sarah,

‘digitize2dmulti’ is not a function in geomorph. This was written outside of geomorph, and not by a member of the current geomorph development team.

However, geomorph does have a 2D digitizing function called ‘digitize2D’. This may be used to digitize landmarks from multiple specimens. I suggest you download and install geomorph, if your goal is digitizing landmarks in this manner.  Also, the geomorph manual has step by step instructions beginning on page 123. You may find this at:

https://github.com/geomorphR/geomorph/raw/gh-pages/geomorph%20user%20guide/Quick_Guide_to_Geomorph-3.0.pdf

Dean

