Subject: Re: [geomorph-r-package] Landmark orientation and adding grouping information
Message-ID: <xt8XB1nQ1uo.jZKbYXyWAwAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <xt8XB1nQ1uo.s2fZzB5JAwAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
